# StoryGlass environment notes

## Local
```
node scripts/local-relay.mjs   # optional; SPA also works via /api/resolve on Vercel
node scripts/dev-server.mjs
```

## Vercel
- Static site + `api/resolve.js` serverless function
- Optional env: `IG_SESSIONID` (Instagram session cookie). Not a stealth viewer — Meta may list that account.

## Cloudflare Worker (optional alternate relay)
```
wrangler deploy worker/cors-relay.js --name storyglass-relay
wrangler secret put IG_SESSIONID
```
